IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SVG-XPATH-WORKER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SVG-CMD-COUNT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CSS-MATCH-FLAG      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MIPMAP-LEVELS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PIPELINE-SCORE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SVG-XPATH-WORKER.
    IF SVG-CMD-COUNT == 0
        GO TO PIPELINE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF CSS-MATCH-FLAG == 0
        GO TO PIPELINE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF MIPMAP-LEVELS < 2
        GO TO PIPELINE-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9999 TO PIPELINE-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 SVG-CMD-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 MIPMAP-LEVELS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

PIPELINE-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO PIPELINE-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
